It's all on Slack.

00:17:45.919 --> 00:17:48.210
Like everyone can come in
and come see what's going on,

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:50.474
pretty open about our
process and how we do stuff.

00:17:50.474 --> 00:17:52.890
We're very open to anyone
coming in and contributing stuff

00:17:52.890 --> 00:17:54.540
as well, which we've had,
which has been really great.

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:55.440
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Do
