MARK MANDEL: I do
have those answers.

00:18:05.121 --> 00:18:07.650
So we currently have
17 contributors.

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:08.320
There we go.

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:10.320
We are definitely looking
for more contributors.

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:13.920
We have Help Wanted
