a bunch of other people

00:22:27.260 --> 00:22:28.989
as well who's doing
it in the open.

00:22:28.989 --> 00:22:31.280
We can all help each other
come to really good go goal.

00:22:31.280 --> 00:22:31.840
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Cool.

00:22:31.840 --> 00:22:34.048
CYRIL TOVENA: We're getting
